<!--
    FULL-ORG AUDIT MANIFEST
    -----------------------
    Use with:  sf project retrieve start -x manifest/package.xml -o <orgAlias>
    Notes:
      * Wildcards (*) only work for types that support them. Settings, StandardValueSet,
        and a few others MUST be listed by name (see those sections below).
      * Some types only exist if the related feature is enabled (Bots, Messaging,
        Territory2, Experience Cloud, Field Service, etc.). Salesforce will simply
        ignore those types if the feature is off — it will NOT fail the retrieve.
      * If you get "INVALID_TYPE" errors, comment out the offending block and re-run.
      * To shrink retrieve size, use `sf project generate manifest --from-org <alias>`
        to produce a manifest scoped to what actually exists.
-->
